  <entry>
    <title>ESP32 - Day 1</title>
    <link href="/ESP32-1/"/>
    <url>/ESP32-1/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="一、问题背景"><a href="#一、问题背景" class="headerlink" title="一、问题背景"></a>一、问题背景</h2><p>使用一块第三方 <code>ESP32-S3-N16R8</code> 开发板，通过 PlatformIO 上传 Arduino 程序，最初准备控制 WS2812B 16×16 LED 矩阵。</p><p>开发板信息：</p><ul><li>主控：ESP32-S3</li><li>Flash：16MB</li><li>PSRAM：8MB</li><li>串口芯片：CH343</li><li>串口：COM5</li><li>板载 RGB LED：GPIO48</li><li>外接 LED 矩阵数据线：GPIO4</li></ul><p><code>N16R8</code> 的含义：</p><ul><li><code>N16</code>：16MB Flash</li><li><code>R8</code>：8MB PSRAM</li></ul><h2 id="二、最初的-LED-测试"><a href="#二、最初的-LED-测试" class="headerlink" title="二、最初的 LED 测试"></a>二、最初的 LED 测试</h2><p>为了排除外接 LED 矩阵接线和供电问题，先使用 FastLED 测试板载 RGB LED：</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;Arduino.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;FastLED.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">define</span> ONBOARD_RGB_PIN 48</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">define</span> NUM_LEDS 1</span><br><br>CRGB onboardLed[NUM_LEDS];<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">showColor</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">const</span> CRGB&amp; color)</span> </span>&#123;<br>    onboardLed[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] = color;<br>    FastLED.<span class="hljs-built_in">show</span>();<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">delay</span>(<span class="hljs-number">500</span>);<br><br>    onboardLed[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] = CRGB::Black;<br>    FastLED.<span class="hljs-built_in">show</span>();<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">delay</span>(<span class="hljs-number">200</span>);<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">setup</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> </span>&#123;<br>    Serial.<span class="hljs-built_in">begin</span>(<span class="hljs-number">115200</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">delay</span>(<span class="hljs-number">500</span>);<br><br>    FastLED.<span class="hljs-built_in">addLeds</span>&lt;WS2812B, ONBOARD_RGB_PIN, GRB&gt;(onboardLed, NUM_LEDS);<br>    FastLED.<span class="hljs-built_in">setBrightness</span>(<span class="hljs-number">30</span>);<br>    FastLED.<span class="hljs-built_in">clear</span>();<br>    FastLED.<span class="hljs-built_in">show</span>();<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">loop</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> </span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">showColor</span>(CRGB::Red);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">showColor</span>(CRGB::Green);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">showColor</span>(CRGB::Blue);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">showColor</span>(CRGB::White);<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>程序预期让板载 RGB LED 按照以下顺序循环：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">红色 → 绿色 → 蓝色 → 白色<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>但是上传后 LED 没有按照程序运行，Device Monitor 中出现了启动错误。</p><h2 id="三、PlatformIO-编译问题"><a href="#三、PlatformIO-编译问题" class="headerlink" title="三、PlatformIO 编译问题"></a>三、PlatformIO 编译问题</h2><p>最初编译时出现：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">bootloader_dio_40m.elf not found<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>检查 PlatformIO 的 ESP32-S3 框架包后发现，目录中只有：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">bootloader_dio_80m.elf<br>bootloader_opi_80m.elf<br>bootloader_qio_120m.elf<br>bootloader_qio_80m.elf<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>没有 <code>bootloader_dio_40m.elf</code>。</p><p>之后删除并重新安装了以下 PlatformIO 框架包：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">framework-arduinoespressif32<br>framework-arduinoespressif32-esp32s3-libs<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>重新安装后，工程可以正常编译。</p><h2 id="四、发现板卡配置不匹配"><a href="#四、发现板卡配置不匹配" class="headerlink" title="四、发现板卡配置不匹配"></a>四、发现板卡配置不匹配</h2><p>PlatformIO 使用的板卡定义是：</p><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ini"><span class="hljs-attr">board</span> = esp32-s3-devkitc-<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>该板卡定义对应：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1-N8<br>8MB Flash<br>No PSRAM<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>但实际开发板是：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">ESP32-S3-N16R8<br>16MB Flash<br>8MB PSRAM<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>因此不能直接使用官方 N8 板卡的默认配置。</p><p>当前项目中使用的主要配置如下：</p><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ini"><span class="hljs-section">[env:esp32-s3-devkitc-1]</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">platform</span> = espressif32<br><span class="hljs-attr">board</span> = esp32-s3-devkitc-<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">framework</span> = ardui<span class="hljs-literal">no</span><br><br><span class="hljs-attr">monitor_speed</span> = <span class="hljs-number">115200</span><br><br><span class="hljs-attr">board_build.flash_mode</span> = dio<br><span class="hljs-attr">board_build.f_flash</span> = <span class="hljs-number">80000000</span>L<br><span class="hljs-attr">board_build.flash_size</span> = <span class="hljs-number">16</span>MB<br><span class="hljs-attr">board_build.arduino.partitions</span> = default_16MB.csv<br><span class="hljs-attr">board_build.arduino.memory_type</span> = dio_opi<br><span class="hljs-attr">board_build.psram_type</span> = opi<br><br><span class="hljs-attr">build_flags</span> =<br>    -D <span class="hljs-attr">ARDUINO_USB_CDC_ON_BOOT</span>=<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>    -D <span class="hljs-attr">ARDUINO_USB_MODE</span>=<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>    -D BOARD_HAS_PSRAM<br><br><span class="hljs-attr">lib_deps</span> =<br>    fastled/FastLED@^3.6.0<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这些设置对应：</p><ul><li>DIO Flash 模式</li><li>80MHz Flash 频率</li><li>16MB Flash</li><li>8MB OPI PSRAM</li><li>16MB 分区表</li></ul><h2 id="五、上传显示成功，但设备无法启动"><a href="#五、上传显示成功，但设备无法启动" class="headerlink" title="五、上传显示成功，但设备无法启动"></a>五、上传显示成功，但设备无法启动</h2><p>PlatformIO 上传过程中显示：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">Hash of data verified.<br>Hard resetting via RTS pin...<br>========================= [SUCCESS]<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这说明：</p><ul><li>Bootloader 已写入</li><li>分区表已写入</li><li>应用固件已写入</li><li>写入后的数据校验通过</li><li>ESP32 已自动复位</li></ul><p>但是，上传成功并不代表用户程序已经成功启动。</p><p>打开 Device Monitor 后，反复看到：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">E (31) bootloader_flash: XMC flash startup fail<br>E (31) boot.esp32s3: failed when running XMC startup flow, reboot!<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>之后设备不断重复启动：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">ESP-ROM:esp32s3-20210327<br>rst:0x3 (RTC_SW_SYS_RST)<br>boot:0x8 (SPI_FAST_FLASH_BOOT)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>启动过程可以理解为：</p><ol><li>ESP32 ROM 启动正常</li><li>Bootloader 被读取</li><li>Bootloader 开始初始化 Flash</li><li>XMC Flash 初始化失败</li><li>系统自动重启</li><li>用户程序没有执行到 <code>setup()</code></li></ol><p>因此板载 RGB LED 不按程序闪烁是正常现象，因为程序根本没有开始执行。</p><h2 id="六、读取实际-Flash-信息"><a href="#六、读取实际-Flash-信息" class="headerlink" title="六、读取实际 Flash 信息"></a>六、读取实际 Flash 信息</h2><p>关闭 Device Monitor 后，使用 PlatformIO 自带的 esptool 读取 Flash ID：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">&amp; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;C:\Users\32109\.platformio\packages\tool-esptool\esptool.exe&quot;</span> `<br>    <span class="hljs-literal">--chip</span> esp32s3 `<br>    <span class="hljs-literal">--port</span> COM5 `<br>    flash<span class="hljs-literal">-id</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>读取结果：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">Chip type: ESP32-S3 (QFN56)<br>Embedded PSRAM 8MB<br>Manufacturer: 20<br>Device: 7018<br>Detected flash size: 16MB<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>结果确认：</p><ul><li>主控是 ESP32-S3</li><li>PSRAM 是 8MB</li><li>Flash 是 16MB</li><li>Flash 厂商是 XMC</li><li>Flash 可以被 esptool 识别</li></ul><p>同时 esptool 输出：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">WARNING: XMC flash chip boot-up failure detected!<br>WARNING: XMC flash boot-up fix failed.<br>XMC flash chip boot-up fix successful!<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这里要注意：esptool 的修复是在下载工具的临时 Stub Flasher 中进行的，不代表写入设备的 bootloader 已经具备相同的修复逻辑。</p><h2 id="七、完整擦除-Flash"><a href="#七、完整擦除-Flash" class="headerlink" title="七、完整擦除 Flash"></a>七、完整擦除 Flash</h2><p>执行完整擦除：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">&amp; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;C:\Users\32109\.platformio\packages\tool-esptool\esptool.exe&quot;</span> `<br>    <span class="hljs-literal">--chip</span> esp32s3 `<br>    <span class="hljs-literal">--port</span> COM5 `<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">erase</span><span class="hljs-literal">-flash</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>结果：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">XMC flash chip boot-up fix successful!<br>Flash memory erased successfully<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这说明：</p><ul><li>ESP32 主控正常</li><li>XMC Flash 可以通信</li><li>Flash 可以擦除</li><li>硬件不是完全无法使用</li></ul><p>但是重新上传程序后，启动时仍然出现：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">E (31) bootloader_flash: XMC flash startup fail<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>因此，单纯擦除 Flash 不能解决这个启动兼容性问题。</p><h2 id="八、问题根因"><a href="#八、问题根因" class="headerlink" title="八、问题根因"></a>八、问题根因</h2><p>最终确认的问题组合是：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">ESP32-S3<br>+ XMC 16MB Flash<br>+ 当前 Arduino/ESP-IDF bootloader<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>esptool 可以通过临时 Stub Flasher 识别、擦除和写入 XMC Flash，但设备重启后，固件中的 bootloader 无法正确初始化该 XMC Flash，于是产生启动循环。</p><p>这解释了为什么会同时出现：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">上传成功<br>Flash 校验成功<br>设备不断重启<br>程序没有执行<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>问题不在：</p><ul><li>FastLED 程序</li><li>GPIO4 或 GPIO48</li><li>WS2812B 矩阵接线</li><li>USB 连接</li><li>串口驱动</li><li>Flash 擦除操作</li></ul><p>而在于：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">XMC Flash 与当前 ESP32-S3 bootloader 的兼容性<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="九、上传时-LED-闪烁的含义"><a href="#九、上传时-LED-闪烁的含义" class="headerlink" title="九、上传时 LED 闪烁的含义"></a>九、上传时 LED 闪烁的含义</h2><p>上传过程中曾看到蓝色、绿色 LED 闪烁，上传结束后看到红色和绿色 LED 常亮。</p><p>这些灯光不一定是用户程序控制的 RGB LED，也可能是：</p><ul><li>USB 转串口芯片的通信指示灯</li><li>电源指示灯</li><li>下载状态灯</li><li>板载状态灯</li></ul><p>只有在串口中不再出现 <code>XMC flash startup fail</code>，并且程序成功运行后，才能确认 RGB LED 测试程序真的执行了。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
    <tags>
      
